{"id":"62edc804a5403a93","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-zfc-forcing3-separative-modification.md","title":"ZFC Forcing3 Separative Modification","display":"df-zfc-forcing3-separative-modification — ZFC Forcing3 Separative Modification","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-forcing3-separative-modification","aliases":["58-df-zfc-forcing3-separative-modification"],"display":"df-zfc-forcing3-separative-modification — ZFC Forcing3 Separative Modification","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-forcing3-separative-modification"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-forcing3-separative-modification</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-forcing3-separative-modification — ZFC Forcing3 Separative Modification"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb P\\in V\">\\(\\mathbb P\\in V\\)</span> (forcing carrier)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\subseteq\\mathbb P\\times\\mathbb P\">\\(\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\subseteq\\mathbb P\\times\\mathbb P\\)</span> (forcing preorder)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq^*_{\\mathbb P}\\in V\">\\(\\leq^*_{\\mathbb P}\\in V\\)</span> (candidate separative modification)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing3SeparativeModification}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing3SeparativeModification}_S\\)</span> (separative-modification predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing3\\text{-}separative\\text{-}modification}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing3SeparativeModification}_S(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\leq^*_{\\mathbb P})\\leftrightarrow\n\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\subseteq\\mathbb P\\times\\mathbb P\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall p\\in\\mathbb P\\;\\langle p,p\\rangle\\in\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\bigr)\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall p,q,r\\in\\mathbb P\\;(\\langle p,q\\rangle\\in\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\land\\langle q,r\\rangle\\in\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\to\\langle p,r\\rangle\\in\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\bigr)\\land\n\\leq^*_{\\mathbb P}\\subseteq\\mathbb P\\times\\mathbb P\\land\n\\forall p,q\\in\\mathbb P\\;\\Bigl(\\langle p,q\\rangle\\in\\leq^*_{\\mathbb P}\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall r\\in\\mathbb P\\;(\\langle r,p\\rangle\\in\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\to\n\\exists s\\in\\mathbb P\\;(\\langle s,r\\rangle\\in\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\land\\langle s,q\\rangle\\in\\leq_{\\mathbb P}))\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing3\\text{-}separative\\text{-}modification}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing3SeparativeModification}_S(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\leq^*_{\\mathbb P})\\leftrightarrow\n\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\subseteq\\mathbb P\\times\\mathbb P\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall p\\in\\mathbb P\\;\\langle p,p\\rangle\\in\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\bigr)\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall p,q,r\\in\\mathbb P\\;(\\langle p,q\\rangle\\in\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\land\\langle q,r\\rangle\\in\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\to\\langle p,r\\rangle\\in\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\bigr)\\land\n\\leq^*_{\\mathbb P}\\subseteq\\mathbb P\\times\\mathbb P\\land\n\\forall p,q\\in\\mathbb P\\;\\Bigl(\\langle p,q\\rangle\\in\\leq^*_{\\mathbb P}\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall r\\in\\mathbb P\\;(\\langle r,p\\rangle\\in\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\to\n\\exists s\\in\\mathbb P\\;(\\langle s,r\\rangle\\in\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\land\\langle s,q\\rangle\\in\\leq_{\\mathbb P}))\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb P\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\subseteq\\mathbb P\\times\\mathbb P","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq^*_{\\mathbb P}\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing3SeparativeModification}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing3\\text{-}separative\\text{-}modification}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing3SeparativeModification}_S(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\leq^*_{\\mathbb P})\\leftrightarrow\n\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\subseteq\\mathbb P\\times\\mathbb P\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall p\\in\\mathbb P\\;\\langle p,p\\rangle\\in\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\bigr)\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall p,q,r\\in\\mathbb P\\;(\\langle p,q\\rangle\\in\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\land\\langle q,r\\rangle\\in\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\to\\langle p,r\\rangle\\in\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\bigr)\\land\n\\leq^*_{\\mathbb P}\\subseteq\\mathbb P\\times\\mathbb P\\land\n\\forall p,q\\in\\mathbb P\\;\\Bigl(\\langle p,q\\rangle\\in\\leq^*_{\\mathbb P}\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall r\\in\\mathbb P\\;(\\langle r,p\\rangle\\in\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\to\n\\exists s\\in\\mathbb P\\;(\\langle s,r\\rangle\\in\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\land\\langle s,q\\rangle\\in\\leq_{\\mathbb P}))\\Bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1537,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2086","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-forcing3-separative-modification.md|58-df-zfc-forcing3-separative-modification]]（batch15）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3"]}